{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"二、夏六月，公子遂如齊，至黃乃復。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"其言至黃乃復何？有疾也。何言乎有疾乃復？譏。何譏爾？大夫以君命出，聞喪徐行而不反。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"三、辛巳，有事于太廟。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"四、仲遂卒于垂。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"仲遂者何？公子遂也。何以不稱公子？貶。曷為貶？為弒子赤貶。然則曷為不於其弒焉貶？於文則無罪，於子則無年。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"五、壬午猶繹。萬入去籥。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"繹者何？祭之明日也。萬者何？干舞也。籥者何？籥舞也。其言萬入去籥何？去其有聲者，廢其無聲者，存其心焉爾。存其心焉爾者何？知其不可而為之也。猶者何？通可以已也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"六、戊子，夫人熊氏薨。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"七、晉師、白狄伐秦。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"八、楚人滅舒蓼。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"九、秋七月甲子，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"十、冬十月己丑，葬我小君頃熊。雨不克葬。庚寅，日中而克葬。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"頃熊者何？宣公之母也。而者何？難也。乃者何？難也。曷為或言而？或言乃？乃難乎而也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"十一、城平陽。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_122_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_122","textTraditional":"十二、楚師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}